'''Dragons Old and Young''' (古龍と子竜, ''Ko Ryū to Ko Ryū'', '''Ancient Dragon and Child Dragon''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 8.0 Update|Version 8.0]].

==Effect==
"Strong" Effect UP (Sm): The effect of this ability is increased by 10%.

